  "$comment": "Phase 3 slice 2: more machines and recipes. Planks and machine parts, a powered sawmill, machine-made parts and gun parts, and plank furniture that is chosen only while planks are in stock. Loaded last so nothing earlier changes order. Which tech unlocks what is listed in research.json. Machines and generators are serviced with a machine part, so parts stay in demand while machines run. Phase 3 slice 4: power storage. A battery bank (unlocked by Power storage, which needs Electricity) stores a generator's surplus and covers shortfalls; the colony puts one beside the generator of each network.",
